WEBVTT

00:11:58.057 --> 00:12:00.857
Táto zem je mojím jediným domovom.

00:12:01.479 --> 00:12:07.732
A tam pevne stojí aj moje srdce.

00:12:07.732 --> 00:12:09.935
Kde stojí to vaše?

00:12:10.001 --> 00:12:10.873
Ďakujem.

00:12:10.873 --> 00:12:11.753
(potlesk)

00:12:11.753 --> 00:12:12.985
Ďakujem.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:14.311
Kòp kun ka.

00:12:14.978 --> 00:12:16.945
(potlesk a ovácie)